# Outliers Removal 

## 9 Participants Removed from Correct Stop-N200 Amplitudes for All Participants

```{r corr N200 outliers all}
outliers <- dfMerged %>%
  group_by(Sex, Dx) %>%
  identify_outliers(N2_FCz_AllCorrectAvg)
